# Normalize every text file to LF in both the repository and the working
# tree. This repo is edited from multiple checkouts with different EOL
# configs, which kept flipping whole files (2,000+-line diffs for 3-line
# changes); a committed policy ends that. Binary types are marked explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
